### PHP Constants in Traits

Source: https://github.com/tree-sitter/tree-sitter-php/blob/master/test/corpus/class.txt

Shows how to declare constants within PHP traits. The parse tree captures the structure of a trait declaration containing a constant element.

```PHP
<?php

trait Test {
    public const FLAG_1 = 1;
}
```

